# Probenplaner – UI/UX Design Guidelines

Distilled from the existing settings, sidebar, login, and Meine Meldungen pages.

---

## 1. Design Token System (the Foundation)

Everything stems from **CSS custom properties** defined in [theme-default.css](file:///g:/probenplaner/src/public/assets/css/themes/theme-default.css). Never use raw hex values in components — always reference tokens.

| Category | Pattern | Example tokens |
|---|---|---|
| Brand colors | `--color-primary`, `--color-primary-dark`, `--color-primary-50`…`300` | `#478cf4` as base, alpha steps via `rgba()` |
| Status colors | `--color-success`, `--color-error`, `--color-warning`, `--color-info` + `-light/-dark/-icon/-50/-100/-200` | Green / Red / Amber / Blue |
| Text | `--color-text-primary`, `-secondary`, `-muted`, `-tertiary`, `-inverse` | Dark-to-light hierarchy |
| Backgrounds | `--color-bg-primary`, `-secondary`, `-tertiary` | White → #f9fafb → #f3f4f6 |
| Borders | `--color-border`, `-light`, `-dark` | #e5e7eb scale |
| Spacing | `--space-1` to `--space-24` | 4 px → 96 px (¼ rem steps) |
| Typography | `--font-size-xs`…`4xl`, `--font-weight-light`…`extrabold` | 12 px – 36 px |
| Radii | `--radius-sm`…`full` | 4 px – 9999 px |
| Shadows | `--shadow-sm`…`2xl` | Layered rgba shadows |
| Transitions | `--transition-fast/base/slow` | 150 / 200 / 300 ms cubic-bezier |
| Z-index | `--z-dropdown` to `--z-toast` | 1000 – 1080 |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dark mode** is supported by overriding these tokens in `html.dark-mode` / `html[data-theme-mode="dark"]`. All component CSS that uses tokens automatically adapts.

---

## 2. Color Philosophy

- **Primary accent**: `#478cf4` blue, used in gradients: `linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-primary-dark))`
- **Secondary accent**: `#f4476b` pink, used sparingly for decorative radial gradients on auth screens
- **Status triad**: Green `#10b981` (success/attending), Red `#ef4444` (error/not-attending), Gray `#d1d5db` (no-response/neutral)
- **Icon variants**: Status icons get a lighter/more saturated version (`--color-success-icon: #22d394`) for better visual pop
- **Layered opacity steps** (`-50`, `-100`, `-200`) allow ambient tinting without hard borders (e.g., button backgrounds `linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-success-50), var(--color-success-100))`)

---

## 3. Layout Architecture

### Authenticated Layout
```
┌──────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Sidebar  │ Top Navigation (title + actions)       │
│ (fixed)  ├────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 280px    │ #contentPage                           │
│          │   max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6          │
│          │   OR w-full h-full p-0 (isFluid)       │
└──────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Sidebar slides out left (`translateX(-100%)`) on mobile, always visible `>=900px`
- Main content shifts right via `margin-left: var(--sidebar-width)`
- `isFluid` flag strips padding for full-bleed pages (e.g., settings with own gradient)

### Guest/Auth Layout
```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ .auth-screen (full viewport flex column)           │
│ ├── gradient bg + radial color blobs               │
│ ├── .centered-card-container (flex center)         │
│ │     └── .centered-card-wrapper (max-width 400px) │
│ │           └── form content                       │
│ └── .auth-screen-footer (legal links)              │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Base: `linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #f1f5f9)` — subtle warm-to-cool
- Decorative overlay: two `radial-gradient` blobs (blue top-left, pink bottom-right) at 10% opacity → depth without heaviness
- Content vertically centered with `margin: auto 0` — ghost element enforces symmetry

---

## 4. Sidebar Design

What makes it premium:

| Technique | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Avatar gradient** | `linear-gradient(135deg, --color-primary, --color-primary-dark)` with subtle `box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(59,130,246,0.15)` |
| **Stats section gradient** | `linear-gradient(31deg, var(--color-bg-tertiary), var(--color-primary-100))` — faint brand tint |
| **Segmented bar** | 4 px high bar with green/red/gray segments, `inset box-shadow` for recessed look |
| **Nav hover** | Gradient background + `translateX(2px)` nudge + `box-shadow` |
| **Active indicator** | `::before` pseudo-element: 3 px wide × 20 px high gradient pill on the left edge |
| **Active background** | `linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-100), var(--color-primary-200))` + blue shadow |
| **Thin scrollbar** | `scrollbar-width: thin` + custom `::-webkit-scrollbar` styling |
| **Text overflow** | Names/details use `text-overflow: ellipsis` → never break layout |

